0..68 Comment "// What codata refuses. A family\'s kind is a computation universe; a"
69..145 Comment "// copattern block answers each observation once; a call claiming `>` is the"
146..220 Comment "// whole arm of a copattern block, and one anywhere else — under another"
221..296 Comment "// call, under `become`, outside any block — is refused by name until `>`"
297..346 Comment "// carries the sized rung\'s evidence. The twin of"
347..385 Comment "// `../../model/codata/streams.gandr`."
